{"transcript":"nɔudbuk","exists":true,"definitions":["Kompyuterning ixcham, ko'chma turi.","Shaxsiy kompyuterning bir turi bo'lib, u batareya quvvati bilan ishlaydi va osongina tashish mumkin."],"examples":["Men yangi noutbuk sotib oldim.","Noutbukimni uyda unutibman.","U noutbukda ishlayapti."],"lemma":"noutbuk","lemmaPos":"noun","synonyms":["laptop","kompyuter"],"number":"singular","pluralForm":"noutbuklar","source":"noutbuk"}